              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kwonka Petero yaamwimutsya, naagira ati: Imuka; naanye ndi omuntu nkaiwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.10.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.10.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 10:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku yaabaire naakigamba nawe, yaataahamu, yaashanga baingi bateeraine; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.10.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.10.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 10:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yaabagira ati: Imwe nimumanya ku kizira Omuyudaaya okukwatanisa n'omuntu w'eihanga erindi, n'obu kwakuba kumutaayaayira; kwonka nyowe Ruhanga akaanyoreka ku ntashemereire kunuga muntu weena nari shi okumweta otashemeire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.10.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.10.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 10:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N'ahabw'ekyo, ku nyetsirwe, tinaayanga kwija. Nikyo ndikubuuriza eki muunyeteire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.10.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.10.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 10:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Koruneelio yaagira ati: Ebiro bina ebihingwire mbaire ninshabira omu nju yangye aha shaaha y'okushaba eya mwnea; ku mbaire ninshaba, naareeba omushaija anyemereire omumaisho, ajwaire ebijwaro ebirikwengyengyeta, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.10.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.10.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 10:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yaagira ati: Koruneelio, okushaba kwawe kuhuriirwe, n'obuhwezi bwawe bwijukirwe ahari Ruhanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.10.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.10.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 10:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N'ahabw'ekyo tuma Yoopa, oyeteyo Simooni orikwetwa Petero; hati naaraara omu nju ya Simooni omuhazi w'empu aha rubaju rw'enyanja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.10.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.10.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 10:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahonaaho naakutumaho; kandi naiwe waakora gye kwija. Mbwenu hati turi aha twena omu maisho ga Ruhanga okuhurira byona ebi oragiirwe Mukama.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.10.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.10.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
